  "question": {
    "text": "A wire fixed to the ceiling at one end is being pulled slowly by a force&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></math>&nbsp;at the other end.&nbsp;If the change in length of the wire is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>l</mtext></math>, then the work done&nbsp;by the force <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>F</mtext></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Fl</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>2Fl</mtext></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>Fl</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Young's modulus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Y</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>FL</mtext><mtext>Al</mtext></mfrac></math> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; ............(i)<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>F</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>YAl</mtext><mtext>L</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math mrow=\"\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>dW</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Fdl</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>YAl</mtext><mfenced><mtext>dl</mtext></mfenced></mrow><mtext>L</mtext></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∫</mo><mtext>dW</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>YA</mtext><mtext>L</mtext></mfrac><munderover><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mtext>l</mtext></munderover><mtext>ldl</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mtext>YAl</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>L</mtext></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Work done <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mtext>YAl</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ...............(ii)<br /><br />From (i) and (ii)<br /><br />Work done = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mtext>Fl</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
}